    <iao:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This class encodes a relationship between a chemical and a molecular initiating event. It is possible that a given chemical and MIE have more than one relationship. For instance, a selective estrogen receptor modulator (SERM) may activate and deactivate estrogen receptor activity, resulting in more than one relationship.</iao:IAO_0000115>
